  "decisions": [
    "Replace aggregate hot-sweep waits with independently correlated per-seat reads, one pending live read and parse job/result per seat, separate bounded history completion.",
    "Publish only a matching attachment, owner incarnation and starting cursor. Keep ring tail, checkpoint debt/durability and replay effect suppression.",
    "Preserve the admitted connection/lease, including the profiling observer; never create a second diagnostic lease. Bound socket frames and late correlation slots, with nonblocking frame IO.",
    "Service bounded fair ingestion quanta; count read/parser admission as progress. Busy retries are seat-local. Parser CPU lanes are capped at min(4,runtime_workers-1), minimum1, and yield on bounded record/byte quanta.",
    "Root ATTRIBUTION.md already covers project-authored source; new modules retain its canonical identity, governing license and absolute policy URL. No unrelated license-copy changes.",
    "Land the structural partial fix if signed gates pass; leave #47 open while the unchanged quiet latency verdict fails. No plugin host or Settings implementation change."
  ],
